        "hideComponent": "false",
        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Easy access to daylight, fresh air, and nature</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Filtered water throughout the building</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">High-quality, locally-sourced, and healthy meal options, with free fruit on Tuesdays and Thursdays</span></span></span></p>\n",
